WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.985
Open Children and check your class. Photo flashcards help you learn the names.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.819
Choose Learn names. Try to recall the name, then reveal it.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.945
Choose Got it to move to the next card.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.204
For a name you’re still learning, choose Practice again.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.281
Keep going through your class, one face at a time.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.996
Review your round, then practice the remaining name again.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:29.913
Results aren’t saved. Come back whenever you want more practice.
